  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Resilience enhancement project through integrated support for education, protection and livelihood of the Palorinya Refugee Settlement and Host Community in Obongi District, Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construct, renovate fence and equip ECD centers with age-appropriate play and learning materials, Support the feeding program in the ECD centers, Support ECD facilitators/teachers with required incentives, Train ECD Caregivers and teachers of lower primary on effective teaching practices, Create agricultural farms to produce corps (mazes, beans and sorghums) for feeding poultry attached to ECD centers, Conduct awareness creation and community dialogues on CP, GVB and Peace, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased access to Quality Early Learning opportunities and school readiness for children aged 3-8 years in Palorinya refugee settlement and host communities, Strengthened socio-economic capacity of vulnerable households in Palorinya refugee settlement and host communities, Increased access to the service for prevention and response to the child protection, GBV and conflict in Palorinya refugee settlement and host communities1. &#xd314;&#xb85c;&#xc789;&#xc57c; &#xb09c;&#xbbfc;&#xc815;&#xcc29;&#xcd0c; &#xbc0f; &#xc218;&#xc6a9;&#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xb0b4; 3-8&#xc138; &#xc601;&#xc720;&#xc544; &#xbc0f; &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c4;&#xd559; &#xc900;&#xbe44;&#xb3c4; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;
2. &#xd314;&#xb85c;&#xc789;&#xc57c; &#xb09c;&#xbbfc; &#xc815;&#xcc29;&#xcd0c; &#xbc0f; &#xc218;&#xc6a9; &#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xb0b4; &#xcde8;&#xc57d; &#xac00;&#xad6c;/&#xc591;&#xc721;&#xc790;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
3. &#xd314;&#xb85c;&#xc789;&#xc57c; &#xb09c;&#xbbfc; &#xc815;&#xcc29;&#xcd0c; &#xbc0f; &#xc218;&#xc6a9; &#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xbcf4;&#xd638;, &#xc820;&#xb354;&#xae30;&#xbc18;&#xd3ed;&#xb825;, &#xac08;&#xb4f1;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc608;&#xbc29;&#xacfc; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
